  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Joint-Project for SAFE Access to Fuel and Energy Plus (SAFE+ Phase 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme&apos;s objective is to contribute to the overall food and nutrition security, empowerment and resilience of Rohingya refugees and host communities in Cox&apos;s Bazar, Bangladesh. Targeted individuals and communities will benefit from greater food and nutrition security and reduced risk exposure to gender-based violence through sustained access to cleaner cooking fuel and improved natural resource management to enhance resilience to climate shocks.</narrative>
  </description>
